    <!-- Setup -->
    <string name="setup_title">Setup and info</string>
    <string name="setup_intro">WakeBridge doesn\'t talk to your watch itself. Gadgetbridge tells it when you fall asleep and wake up, and WakeBridge asks Gadgetbridge to set alarms on the watch. Make these settings in Gadgetbridge once, for the watch you sleep with. Gadgetbridge must stay connected to the watch.</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_title">1. Sleep events</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_body">In Gadgetbridge, open the watch\'s settings from its card on the main screen, then Generic > Device actions > On Fall Asleep:\n• Run action: tick Send Broadcast\n• Broadcast message: leave it as it is\n• Broadcast package: enter</string>
    <string name="setup_copy">Copy</string>
    <string name="setup_copied">Copied</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_more">Then do the same under On Wake Up.\n\nIf your watch has no Device actions, or no On Fall Asleep, it doesn\'t report falling asleep: only the plain countdown works.</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_title">2. Alarms</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_body">In the watch\'s settings, open Developer settings and, under Intent API, turn on Allow 3rd party apps to set alarms.\n\nWakeBridge uses an alarm slot that is off and has no name. Keep at least one such alarm in Gadgetbridge\'s alarm list. WakeBridge\'s alarms are named WakeBridge, and it only ever touches those.</string>
    <string name="setup_step3_title">3. Watch</string>
    <string name="setup_choose_watch">Choose watch</string>
    <string name="setup_watch_chosen">Alarms go to: %s</string>
    <string name="setup_watch_none">No watch chosen yet</string>
    <string name="setup_step4_title">4. Check</string>
    <string name="setup_step4_body">Send a test alarm for about 2 minutes from now: it should appear in Gadgetbridge\'s alarm list and go off on the watch. If it doesn\'t, check step 2 and the watch address. Remove it afterwards to free the slot.\n\nThe next time you fall asleep with the watch on, the times below should change.</string>
    <string name="setup_test_alarm">Test alarm</string>
    <string name="setup_remove_test_alarm">Remove test alarm</string>
    <string name="setup_never">never</string>
